        byte_index = ptls_asn1_read_length(bytes, bytes_max, byte_index, length, &is_indefinite, last_byte, decode_error, 0, log_ctx);
    }
    return byte_index;
}
```

ptls_asn1_read_length returns the byte_index pointing past the length field. `*length` is set to the content length. `*last_byte` is set to byte_index + *length.

