```

byte_index now points to the OID value. oid_length is the OID value length.

```c
if (*decode_error == 0) {
    ...
    byte_index += oid_length;
}
```

byte_index = start_of_oid_value + oid_length = last_oid_byte.

And we know last_oid_byte <= last_byte1 (checked in read_length). So byte_index <= last_byte1.

