- Version: 0x02 0x01 0x00
- Inner SEQUENCE: 0x30, some length L
- OID: 0x06, length such that byte_index after OID == original bytes_max

Let me be concrete. Suppose original bytes_max = N.
- bytes[0] = 0x30 (outer SEQUENCE type)
- bytes[1] = N-2 (outer SEQUENCE length, so last_byte0 = N)
- bytes[2..4] = 0x02 0x01 0x00 (version)
